以下是一份從零開始、一步步搭建一個完整電商前端介面的實作指南。  
我會先列出整體流程，接著針對每個環節給出具體的技術選型、工具與範例程式碼，最後再說明測試、優化與部署的要點。

---

## 1️⃣ 規劃 & 設計

| 步驟 | 重點 | 工具 / 建議 |
|------|------|-------------|
| **需求梳理** | 確認功能清單：商品瀏覽、搜尋、分類、收藏、購物車、結帳、支付、訂單查詢、用戶中心等 | 用紙筆或線上表格（Google Sheet） |
| **資訊架構** | 定義頁面層級、URL 結構、導航方式 | Mindmap 或 Figma 的「Site Map」 |
| **原型設計** | 製作低保真到高保真的互動原型 | Figma / Adobe XD / Sketch |
| **視覺設計** | 色彩、字體、圖示、排版規則 | Figma / Adobe Illustrator |

> **小技巧**：在原型階段就把「加入購物車」→「結帳」→「付款成功」這條主流程畫好，確保 UX 流暢。

---

## 2️⃣ 技術棧決策

| 類別 | 推薦方案 | 為什麼選擇 |
|------|----------|------------|
| **框架** | **React** (Create‑React‑App / Vite) <br> 或 **Vue 3** (Vite + Pinia) <br> 或 **SvelteKit** | 目前最流行、社群活躍、豐富的 UI 套件 |
| **UI 库** | Ant Design / Material‑UI / Tailwind CSS + Headless UI | 快速組件化、可自定義 |
| **狀態管理** | Redux Toolkit / Zustand / Pinia | 購物車、用戶資料共享 |
| **路由** | React Router / Vue Router | SPA 導航 |
| **API 通訊** | Axios / Fetch API | 與後端 REST / GraphQL 交互 |
| **樣式** | SCSS / PostCSS / CSS Modules | 模組化、易維護 |
| **打包** | Vite / Webpack | 快速開發、熱更新 |
| **測試** | Jest + Testing Library / Cypress | 單元 + E2E 測試 |
| **CI/CD** | GitHub Actions / GitLab CI | 自動化部署、回滾 |

> **備註**：如果你想快速起步且不想寫太多樣式，可以直接使用 Tailwind + Headless UI；若需要更完整的 UI 元素，Ant Design 或 MUI 更合適。

---

## 3️⃣ 開發流程

### 3.1 初始化專案

```bash
# 使用 Vite + React
npm create vite@latest my-ecommerce --template react-ts
cd my-ecommerce
npm install
```

### 3.2 安裝依賴

```bash
# UI 框架
npm i antd # 或 npm i @mui/material @emotion/react @emotion/styled

# 狀態管理
npm i @reduxjs/toolkit react-redux

# 路由
npm i react-router-dom

# API
npm i axios

# 樣式
npm i tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
```

### 3.3 設置全局配置

#### `src/index.tsx`

```tsx
import React from 'react';
import ReactDOM from 'react-dom/client';
import { BrowserRouter } from 'react-router-dom';
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import store from './store';
import App from './App';
import 'antd/dist/reset.css'; // 若使用 Ant Design
// import './index.css'; // 若使用 Tailwind

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <Provider store={store}>
      <BrowserRouter>
        <App />
      </BrowserRouter>
    </Provider>
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

#### `src/store/index.ts`

```ts
import { configureStore } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';
import cartReducer from './slices/cartSlice';

export default configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
  },
});
```

#### `src/store/slices/cartSlice.ts`

```ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from '@reduxjs/toolkit';

interface CartItem {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  price: number;
  quantity: number;
}

const initialState: CartItem[] = [];

export const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: 'cart',
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<CartItem>) {
      const existing = state.find(item => item.id === action.payload.id);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<string>) {
      return state.filter(item => item.id !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart() {
      return [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

### 3.4 路由設定

#### `src/App.tsx`

```tsx
import { Routes, Route } from 'react-router-dom';
import HomePage from './pages/HomePage';
import ProductDetail from './pages/ProductDetail';
import CartPage from './pages/CartPage';
import CheckoutPage from './pages/CheckoutPage';
import OrderSuccess from './pages/OrderSuccess';

function App() {
  return (
    <Routes>
      <Route path="/" element={<HomePage />} />
      <Route path="/product/:id" element={<ProductDetail />} />
      <Route path="/cart" element={<CartPage />} />
      <Route path="/checkout" element={<CheckoutPage />} />
      <Route path="/success" element={<OrderSuccess />} />
    </Routes>
  );
}
export default App;
```

### 3.5 基本頁面骨架

#### `src/pages/HomePage.tsx`

```tsx
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import axios from 'axios';
import { Card, Row, Col, Spin } from 'antd';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

interface Product {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  image: string;
  price: number;
}

export default function HomePage() {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);

  useEffect(() => {
    axios.get('/api/products').then(res => {
      setProducts(res.data);
      setLoading(false);
    });
  }, []);

  if (loading) return <Spin tip="載入中..." />;

  return (
    <Row gutter={[16, 16]}>
      {products.map(p => (
        <Col xs={24} sm={12} md={8} lg={6} key={p.id}>
          <Card
            hoverable
            cover={<img alt={p.title} src={p.image} />}
            actions={[
              <Link to={`/product/${p.id}`}>查看</Link>,
              <button onClick={() => {/* dispatch(addToCart(...)) */}}>加入購物車</button>,
            ]}
          >
            <Card.Meta title={p.title} description={`$${p.price}`} />
          </Card>
        </Col>
      ))}
    </Row>
  );
}
```

> **提示**：將 `addToCart` 的 dispatch 放進按鈕事件即可。

#### `src/pages/ProductDetail.tsx`

```tsx
import { useParams } from 'react-router-dom';
import { useEffect, useState } from 'react';
import axios from 'axios';
import { Button, Spin } from 'antd';
import { useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { addToCart } from '../store/slices/cartSlice';

export default function ProductDetail() {
  const { id } = useParams<{ id: string }>();
  const [product, setProduct] = useState<any>(null);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  useEffect(() => {
    axios.get(`/api/products/${id}`).then(res => {
      setProduct(res.data);
      setLoading(false);
    });
  }, [id]);

  if (loading) return <Spin tip="載入中..." />;

  return (
    <div>
      <h1>{product.title}</h1>
      <img src={product.image} alt={product.title} style={{ maxWidth: '100%' }} />
      <p>{product.description}</p>
      <p>價格：${product.price}</p>
      <Button type="primary" onClick={() => dispatch(addToCart({ ...product, quantity: 1 }))}>
        加入購物車
      </Button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

#### `src/pages/CartPage.tsx`

```tsx
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { removeFromCart, clearCart } from '../store/slices/cartSlice';
import { List, Button, Divider } from 'antd';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function CartPage() {
  const cart = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.cart);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();

  const total = cart.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.price * item.quantity, 0);

  return (
    <div>
      <h2>購物車</h2>
      <List
        bordered
        dataSource={cart}
        renderItem={item => (
          <List.Item
            actions={[
              <Button danger onClick={() => dispatch(removeFromCart(item.id))}>移除</Button>,
            ]}
          >
            {item.name} ×{item.quantity} = ${item.price * item.quantity}
          </List.Item>
        )}
      />
      <Divider />
      <h3>總金額：${total.toFixed(2)}</h3>
      <Button type="primary" disabled={!cart.length} onClick={() => {/* navigate('/checkout') */}}>
        前往結帳
      </Button>
      <Button danger disabled={!cart.length} onClick={() => dispatch(clearCart())}>
        清空購物車
      </Button>
    </div>
  );
}
```

#### `src/pages/CheckoutPage.tsx`

```tsx
import { Form, InputNumber, Button, Select, message } from 'antd';
import { useSelector, useDispatch } from 'react-redux';
import { RootState } from '../store';
import { clearCart } from '../store/slices/cartSlice';
import axios from 'axios';
import { useNavigate } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function CheckoutPage() {
  const cart = useSelector((state: RootState) => state.cart);
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  const navigate = useNavigate();

  const handleFinish = async (values: any) => {
    try {
      await axios.post('/api/orders', { items: cart, shipping: values.shippingAddress });
      dispatch(clearCart());
      navigate('/success');
    } catch (err) {
      message.error('下單失敗，請稍後重試');
    }
  };

  return (
    <Form layout="vertical" onFinish={handleFinish}>
      <Form.Item label="收貨地址" name="shippingAddress" rules={[{ required: true }]}>
        <Input.TextArea rows={4} />
      </Form.Item>

      <Form.Item label="付款方式" name="paymentMethod" rules={[{ required: true }]}>
        <Select options={[{ value: 'credit_card', label: '信用卡' }, { value: 'paypal', label: 'PayPal' }]} />
      </Form.Item>

      <Button type="primary" htmlType="submit">
        完成訂單
      </Button>
    </Form>
  );
}
```

#### `src/pages/OrderSuccess.tsx`

```tsx
import { Result, Button } from 'antd';
import { Link } from 'react-router-dom';

export default function OrderSuccess() {
  return (
    <Result
      status="success"
      title="訂單已完成！"
      subTitle="感謝您的購買，我們將盡快處理並寄送至您提供的地址。"
      extra={[
        <Link to="/">
          <Button type="primary">返回首頁</Button>
        </Link>,
        <Link to="/orders">
          <Button>查看訂單</Button>
        </Link>,
      ]}
    />
  );
}
```

> **備註**：上述範例假設 `/api/*` 已經有後端接口支援。若你還沒有後端，可先用 Mock Service Worker (MSW) 或 JSON Server 做 mock。

---

## 4️⃣ 測試

### 4.1 單元測試

```bash
npm i jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom ts-jest -D
```

#### `src/components/__tests__/AddToCart.test.tsx`

```tsx
import { render, screen, fireEvent } from '@testing-library/react';
import { Provider } from 'react-redux';
import store from '../../store';
import AddToCartButton from '../AddToCartButton';

test('click adds item to cart', () => {
  render(
    <Provider store={store}>
      <AddToCartButton product={{ id: '1', name: 'Test', price: 10, quantity: 1 }} />
    </Provider>
  );

  fireEvent.click(screen.getByText(/加入購物車/i));
  expect(store.getState().cart).toHaveLength(1);
});
```

### 4.2 E2E 測試

```bash
npm i cypress -D
```

#### `cypress/e2e/shop.cy.js`

```js
describe('Shop Flow', () => {
  it('should allow adding to cart and checking out', () => {
    cy.visit('/');
    cy.contains('查看').first().click(); // 進入產品詳情
    cy.contains('加入購物車').click();
    cy.contains('購物車').click();
    cy.contains('前往結帳').click();
    cy.get('textarea').type('123 Fake St.');
    cy.get('select').select('信用卡');
    cy.contains('完成訂單').click();
    cy.contains('訂單已完成！');
